{
  "packet": 3,
  "translations": [
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Kaz，以你这个前游骑兵的经验给我点意见。发动游击战时要注意什么？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"游击部队的规模、火力和持续作战能力通常都远逊于敌方正规军。战斗拖得越久越不利，所以必须速战速决，这是基本原则。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"战术上确实如此。那么战略层面呢？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"兵力与后勤基础薄弱，令游击队处处受限。比如补给不得不依靠就地筹措，没有农民援助，很难把游击战坚持到底。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"而要利用地利，也少不了熟悉当地情况的居民协助。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"因此必须赢得民心。为取得信任，游击战士必须保持高尚品行。指挥官应当明白，维持部队纪律是一项直接关系胜败的重要任务。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"简直就是“<R=争取民心行动,HEARTS AND MINDS>”。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"绿扁帽部队搞的那套？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"<R=英国人,SAS>在马来亚也是这么做的。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"思路是一样的。没有哪支军队能与民众为敌而取胜。“阿拉伯的劳伦斯”也是如此，他赢得当地贝都因人的拥护并击败德军，早已广为人知。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"没错……说起来，你们国家的孙子是不是也说过类似的话？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"啊？不，孙子不是日本人，是中国人……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"不愧是号称第五文明圈的国家。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":13,"cn_text":"第五？……你是在说汤因比那一套吗？","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":14,"cn_text":"对。你懂得真多。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":15,"cn_text":"可按他的说法不是五个，而是26个……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":16,"cn_text":"那是个崇尚武力、孕育出老子、孔明等众多优秀武士的国家。","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B0B0","unique_index":17,"cn_text":"嗯……这个嘛……","review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00B9D0","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"现行宪法本就是在盟军占领期间制定的，草案也是当时由盟军司令部提出。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00C420","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"没错。盟军占领结束以后，美军仍依据《日美安全保障条约》继续驻扎。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00C420","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"苏联近在咫尺，也靠近中国和朝鲜，对太平洋地区的安全保障不可或缺。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00C420","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"尤其是冲绳，两年前才由美国归还，基地又高度集中，给县民造成了沉重负担。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00C420","unique_index":11,"cn_text":"原因很多，当然也有日美力量悬殊的问题。而且一旦废除条约，日本也会脱离美国的核保护伞。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00C420","unique_index":14,"cn_text":"拥有和平宪法的国家，却不得不接纳外国军队……真是讽刺。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00C420","unique_index":18,"cn_text":"日本把军备开支投入经济复兴，如今在美国市场上的份额不断扩大，美国当然不会痛快。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00CDC0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"美国通过宣称盟国一旦遭到核攻击，便会对攻击方实施核打击，以此遏制针对盟国的核攻击。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00CDC0","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"若向莫斯科发射核武器，苏联必然会报复美国。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00CDC0","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"也就是说，苏联也不会冒遭到报复的风险……是吗？","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00D430","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"谁知道。不过日本是唯一遭受过核攻击的国家，民众对核武器的抗拒比你想象得更强烈。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00D8F0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"自卫队是用于保卫本国的组织，不以侵略他国为设想，也就是所谓的专守防卫。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00D8F0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"这是自卫队的基本军事战略：不发动先制攻击，只有受到对方攻击以后，才采取最低限度的防卫行动。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00D8F0","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"当时驻日美军因朝鲜战争几乎全部出动，成立它大概也有填补这一空缺的用意。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00D8F0","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"对了，他们有时也会被派去救灾。我入队前一年，听说为营救坠崖巴士上的人员费了很大功夫。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00DDC0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"母亲三年前去世，我也不再需要照顾她。既然如此，就没必要继续困在日本。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00DDC0","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"我也曾觉得，只要留在自卫队，就永远无法与父亲服役过的美军并肩而立。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"当时的日本房屋几乎全是木结构，仅这一天，东京就有三分之一化为灰烬。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"母亲在这次空袭中失去了家人与住处，于是投奔住在横须贺的表姐。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"到了八月，原子弹落在广岛和长崎，日本终于向美国投降。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"母亲当时才十五六岁，表姐教她如何在这座城市活下去——靠接待美国兵。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"母亲就是在那里认识了父亲，随后有了我。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"父亲是一名军官，在<R=盟军最高司令官总司令部,GHQ>的<R=参谋部民政局,GS>为惠特尼准将工作。","review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":10,"cn_text":"听说他在日本时把母亲当妻子看待，但返回美国以后就再也没有联系。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":12,"cn_text":"母亲独自把我养大。她用父亲留下的一点钱开了家店，向占领军售卖香烟之类的东西。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":13,"cn_text":"日子还算过得去，可我没有国籍。如今虽然有人推动修法，但在日本，不知道父亲是谁就无法登记户籍。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":32,"cn_text":"父亲安排一辆漆黑的轿车来接我。一直嘲笑我发色的邻居们全都瞪大眼睛看着。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":37,"cn_text":"儿子去世又遇上离婚，父亲大概感到寂寞……所以才会对我这种人产生兴趣。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":41,"cn_text":"美国被旷日持久的越南战争拖得筋疲力尽。一边在异国打仗，一边在国内高喊和平。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":43,"cn_text":"多年后再见母亲，她甚至不看我一眼。起初我还以为她在生气。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":44,"cn_text":"但并非如此。病菌侵蚀了她的大脑，是年轻时糟蹋身体落下的病。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":52,"cn_text":"她想与昔日的敌人孕育一个名为“和平”的孩子。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":54,"cn_text":"直到去年的石油危机，战后日本经济一直在增长，试图成为更强大的国家。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_00E980","unique_index":64,"cn_text":"……GHQ造就了母亲那样的女人，造就了日本的和平宪法与自卫队，也造就了我。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_010B70","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"别挖苦我。可惜的是，当时你受雇于政府军一方。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_010B70","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"害得我之后指挥得一塌糊涂，部队最终全军覆没……我自己也被炸弹陷阱重创，命悬一线。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_010B70","unique_index":16,"cn_text":"我说：“我，<R=我们,日本人>再也不会输。”","review_flag":"AUX_REFERENCE_REJECTED_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_010B70","unique_index":21,"cn_text":"那时的你，甚至不惜舍弃<R=尊严,武士之道>也要战斗下去。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT_RUBY_LOCALIZED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_010B70","unique_index":24,"cn_text":"这无关得失或胜败。当时我看着你的活法，找到了自己作为战士应走的路。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_010B70","unique_index":27,"cn_text":"有时，它还会从人群中筛出超越敌我之分的真正伙伴。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011B40","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你应该明白，尽可能避免与敌人交战，Snake。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011B40","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我们人数少，又不熟悉地形。一旦演变成全面战斗，即使是你也免不了一场苦战。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011E60","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Snake，我有件事想拜托你。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011E60","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"怎么突然这么郑重？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011E60","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"要壮大MSF，首先得招募人手。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011E60","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"是啊。然后呢？","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011E60","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"我希望你尽量别杀敌兵，用富尔顿系统把他们回收回来。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011E60","unique_index":5,"cn_text":"毕竟就算回收尸体，我们最多也只能替他们安葬。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011E60","unique_index":6,"cn_text":"确实。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011E60","unique_index":7,"cn_text":"让他们睡着、昏迷……举手投降也行。迫不得已交战时，也尽量只打到濒死。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011E60","unique_index":8,"cn_text":"之后再用富尔顿回收吗……我试试。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_011E60","unique_index":9,"cn_text":"其实要是有种装置，能不由分说地把看中的人直接富尔顿回收，那就轻松多了……","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0122A0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"让士兵睡着或昏迷以后，可以搜身拿走他们的物品。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0122A0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"靠近倒地士兵，出现图标时按<I=ACT>。","review_flag":"CONTROL_PRESERVED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0122A0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"从背后接近并迫使其举手投降的士兵，以及濒死倒地的士兵，也都可以搜身。","review_flag":"SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0125D0","unique_index":0,"cn_text":"武器和装备只带需要的就好。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED_SEGMENTATION_REBUILT"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0125D0","unique_index":1,"cn_text":"什么都塞进背包会重得拖慢行动，最后吃苦的可是你。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0125D0","unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我知道，携行物品只带必要的，这是最基本的常识。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0125D0","unique_index":3,"cn_text":"出发前可以确认携行物品的总重量，记得参考。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"},
    {"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0125D0","unique_index":4,"cn_text":"明白。","review_flag":"CONTEXT_ALIGNMENT_REVIEWED"}
  ]
}
